  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land he fights Nian Er Ping Zhi while purple smoke rises from his injuries. He smiles sinisterly and says he will kill the Sword Child before seeking treasure there. Nian Er Fu leaves that fight alone to take Qing Xuan Zi’s corpse while the two clash.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_nian_er_ping_zhi",
        "sys_sword_child",
        "char_nian_er_fu",
        "char_qing_xuan_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple gas coils around him when he captures iron crown eagles.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "poison-signs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He poisons three iron crown eagles with a weird fragrance, stuffs them into his immortal aperture, and breathes air at He Ruo so she loses control of her body and falls. Nian Er Ping Zhi’s sword light pierces Old Monster Corpse Poison’s body and turns into Nian Er Ping Zhi a hundred steps away, drawing rage that the Sword Child is still finding trouble with him.",
      "chapters": [
        1107
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "poison-capture-and-sword-child",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_ruo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a famous rank seven expert with a deep background. He once joined Zombie Alliance as a living person, then betrayed them; Northern Plains Zombie Alliance tried to capture him and failed each time. Against Nian Er Ping Zhi he is the stronger rank seven, but Nian Er Fu protects the Sword Child from a distance, saves him repeatedly, and injures Old Monster Corpse Poison secretly. He feels regret as others loot while he is stuck in the fight.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "background-and-iron-eagle-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_zombie_alliance",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Afterward he still stares at Nian Er Ping Zhi with hatred and gritted teeth.",
      "chapters": [
        1110
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "background-and-iron-eagle-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At the blood battle martial competition, talk still treats Nian Er Ping Zhi as someone even Old Monster Corpse Poison could not do anything about.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sword-child-reputation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
